Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Permissions|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add DM Document Reg Role Default Permissions
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When Permissions set Up Reg Role PG
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
		|portletName|Documents and Media|
		|roleTitle|Regrole Name|
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And User logout And Login PG
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
	Then AssertElementNotPresent the value 'Add' at locator 'Toolbar#ADD'
Scenario: Add DM Document Reg Role Define Permissions
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When Permissions set Up Reg Role PG
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
		|portletName|Documents and Media|
		|roleTitle|Regrole Name|
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And Permissions define Permission CP
		|permissionDefinitionKey|SITE_ADMIN_CONTENT_DOCUMENTS_AND_MEDIA_RESOURCE_PERMISSIONS_DOCUMENTS_ADD_DOCUMENT_CHECKBOX|
		|permissionDefinitionValue|Add Document|
		|roleTitle|Regrole Name|
	And User logout And Login PG
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
	And DMDocument add PG
		|dmDocumentFile|Document_1.doc|
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_1.doc|
	And User logout And Login PG
		|userLoginEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|Test Test|
	And Permissions remove Permission CP
		|permissionDefinitionKey|SITE_ADMIN_CONTENT_DOCUMENTS_AND_MEDIA_RESOURCE_PERMISSIONS_DOCUMENTS_ADD_DOCUMENT_CHECKBOX|
		|permissionDefinitionValue|Add Document|
		|roleTitle|Regrole Name|
	And User logout And Login PG
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
	Then AssertElementNotPresent the value 'Add' at locator 'Toolbar#ADD'
Scenario: Add DM Document Site Member Role Inline
Priority: 4
	Given Permissions set Up Site Member Role Login User PG
		|page|Public Pages|
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
		|portletName|Documents and Media|
		|siteName|Site Name|
		|siteURLTemp|true|
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	When Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And DMDocument add PG
		|dmDocumentFile|Document_1.doc|
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_1.doc|
	And User logout And Login PG
		|userLoginEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|Test Test|
	And DMDocument tear Down CP
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
		|siteScopeName|Site Name|
	And PermissionsInline goto Documents And Media Home Folder PG
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
		|siteURLTemp|true|
	And Role remove Permission PG
		|permissionDefinitionKey|INLINE_PERMISSIONS_ADD_DOCUMENT_CHECKBOX|
		|roleTitle|Site Member|
	And User logout And Login PG
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet click Portlet Plus Icon PG
		|portletName|Documents and Media|
	And AssertElementNotPresent the value 'Basic Document' at locator 'MenuItem#BASIC_DOCUMENT'
	And User logout And Login PG
		|userLoginEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|Test Test|
	And PermissionsInline goto Documents And Media Home Folder PG
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
		|siteURLTemp|true|
	And Role define Permission PG
		|permissionDefinitionKey|INLINE_PERMISSIONS_ADD_DOCUMENT_CHECKBOX|
		|roleTitle|Site Member|
	And User logout And Login PG
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	Then DMDocument add PG
		|dmDocumentFile|Document_1.doc|
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_2.doc|
