Scenario: View DM Folder Guest Inline
Priority: 4
	Given Page add
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
	When Portlet add PG
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
		|portletName|Documents and Media|
	And Permissions add DM Folder Login User PG
		|dmFolderDescription|DM Folder Description|
		|dmFolderName|DM Folder Name|
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
		|userLoginEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|Test Test|
	And User logout PG
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
	And these variables
		|key_dmFolderName|DM Folder Name|
	And AssertClick the value 'DM Folder Name' at locator 'DocumentsAndMedia#ICON_FOLDER_TITLE'
	And these variables
		|dmFolderNameUpperCase|StringUtil#upperCase('DM Folder Name')|
	And AssertTextEquals assert Partial Text the value '${dmFolderNameUpperCase}' at locator 'DocumentsAndMedia#BREADCRUMB_FOLDER_NAME'
	And User login PG
		|password|test|
		|userEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
	And DMDocument enable Actions Menu On Portlet
	And PermissionsInline goto DM Folder PG
		|dmFolderName|DM Folder Name|
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
	And Role remove Permission PG
		|permissionDefinitionKey|CONTENT_PERMISSIONS_VIEW_CHECKBOX|
		|roleTitle|Guest|
	And User logout PG
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
	And DMPortlet view Default PG
	And User login PG
		|password|test|
		|userEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And PermissionsInline goto DM Folder PG
		|dmFolderName|DM Folder Name|
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
	And Role define Permission PG
		|permissionDefinitionKey|CONTENT_PERMISSIONS_VIEW_CHECKBOX|
		|roleTitle|Guest|
	And User logout PG
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
	And these variables
		|key_dmFolderName|DM Folder Name|
	And AssertClick the value 'DM Folder Name' at locator 'DocumentsAndMedia#ICON_FOLDER_TITLE'
	And these variables
		|dmFolderNameUpperCase|StringUtil#upperCase('DM Folder Name')|
	Then AssertTextEquals assert Partial Text the value '${dmFolderNameUpperCase}' at locator 'DocumentsAndMedia#BREADCRUMB_FOLDER_NAME'